stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Invited : super_admin or platform_admin<br/>POST /internal/admins<br/>(email, name, role, password)

    Invited --> Active : Account created with<br/>is_active = true

    Active --> Deactivated : super_admin can deactivate any admin<br/>platform_admin can deactivate non-super admins<br/>PATCH /internal/admins/:id/deactivate<br/>(cannot deactivate self)

    Deactivated --> Active : super_admin can reactivate any admin<br/>platform_admin can reactivate non-super admins<br/>PATCH /internal/admins/:id/reactivate

    state Active {
        [*] --> Normal
        Normal --> PasswordReset : super_admin only<br/>POST /internal/admins/:id/reset-password<br/>(cannot reset own password)
        PasswordReset --> Normal : Admin signs in with<br/>new password
    }

    note right of Deactivated
        JWT rejected on next request.
        Admin cannot sign in.
        Reversible by reactivation.
    end note

    note right of Active
        Admin can sign in and
        perform actions permitted
        by their role.
    end note
